{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51034","headline":"居天柱山 · 赞宁","name":"居天柱山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四野豁家庭，柴门夜不扃。\n水边成半偈，月下了残经。\n虽逐诸尘转，终归一念醒。\n未知斯旨者，万役尽劳形。\n（《瀛奎律髓》卷四十七《释梵类》。\n）（见陈起《增广圣宋高僧诗选後集》卷上。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赞宁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51034.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51034","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}